<title>UK: Puma prices $700 mln 3-tranche mortgage-backed FRN.</title>
<headline>Puma prices $700 mln 3-tranche mortgage-backed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue, announced earlier by lead manager J.P. Morgan, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PUMA FINANCE LITD</p>
<p> TRANCHE A2</p>
<p> AMT    $560 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  LEGAL MAT   **.OCT.29</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+13 BP    PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES	AVG LIVE 4.97 YRS.</p>
<p>		*STEP-UP TO 3ML +50 BP</p>
<p>		**CALLABLE FROM MARCH 2003</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> TRANCHE A1</p>
<p> AMT    $105 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    **.OCT.29</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+8 BP     PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   12.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES	AVG LIFE 2.05 YRS.</p>
<p>		*STEP-UP TO 3ML +20 BP</p>
<p>		**CALLABLE FROM MARCH 2003</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>THERE ARE ALSO CLASS B NOTES OF $35 MLN, AVG LIFESIX YEARS 3M LIBOR +27 BP STEPPING UP TO 3M LIBOR +75 BP CALLABLE FROM MARCH 2003, FEES TOTAL 40 BP</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p>LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NSW	 HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> NOTES	ALL TRANCHES CALLABLE FROM MARCH.2003</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
